  (27, 5, $svjson${"evidence":{"limitation":"Complete all required fields before submitting. Version 3 (QAFIX-01) enters the application purpose once with a language choice, seats Bangla/English companion fields beside each other, unifies the document-language label and applies the live-QA spelling corrections. Version 4 (QAFIX-06) makes the passport purpose a fixed select (travel, employment, Hajj, Umrah, study, treatment, business, other) whose values the recommendation letter's label map renders in both languages, replacing the free-text purpose. The letter takes the applicant's identity and addresses from the citizen record and carries no payload slot for them, so no identity field is added. Version 5 (QAFIX-10) captures the NID number, date of birth and passport number, and removes the free-text purpose and its language choice — the fixed passport-purpose select is now the only purpose asked. The recommendation letter reads the fixed select through its label map and takes identity from the citizen record, so the new identity fields are office evidence.","source":"audit/evidence/s-27.json","status":"proposed"},"sections":[{"fields":[{"constraints":{"maxLength":17,"minLength":10,"required":true},"evidence":{"status":"proposed"},"id":"nid_number","label":{"bn":"জাতীয় পরিচয়পত্র (এনআইডি) নম্বর","en":"National ID (NID) number"},"type":"text"},{"constraints":{"notFuture":true,"required":true},"evidence":{"status":"proposed"},"id":"date_of_birth","label":{"bn":"জন্ম তারিখ","en":"Date of birth"},"type":"date"},{"constraints":{"maxLength":30},"evidence":{"status":"proposed"},"id":"passport_number","label":{"bn":"পাসপোর্ট নম্বর (যদি থাকে)","en":"Passport number (if any)"},"type":"text"},{"constraints":{"maxLength":500,"minLength":2,"required":true},"evidence":{"fieldNames":["passport_purpose"],"status":"proposed"},"id":"passport_purpose","label":{"bn":"পাসপোর্টের উদ্দেশ্য","en":"Passport purpose"},"options":[{"label":{"bn":"ভ্রমণ","en":"Travel"},"value":"travel"},{"labe