  (31, 5, $svjson${"evidence":{"limitation":"Complete all required fields before submitting. Version 3 (Phase 4) conditions the opt-in group on its toggle and makes the income amount optional where the owner decided so. Version 4 (QAFIX-01) enters the application purpose once with a language choice, seats Bangla/English companion fields beside each other, unifies the document-language label and applies the live-QA spelling corrections. Version 5 (QAFIX-07) makes the date of death always visible (core evidence is never hidden behind the opt-in toggle), replaces the copied relationship list — which offered \"self\" and \"spouse\" for a person who died unmarried — with a deceased-appropriate closed list, and names the deceased in the identity, place and cause labels. The death registration number stays optional: it prints when present, but an unregistered death is one of the cases this certificate exists for.","source":"audit/evidence/s-31.json","status":"proposed"},"sections":[{"fields":[{"constraints":{"maxLength":250,"minLength":2,"required":true},"evidence":{"fieldNames":["dead_info_name_bn"],"source":"audit/evidence/s-31.json","status":"inferred"},"id":"dead_info_name_bn","label":{"bn":"মৃত ব্যক্তির নাম (বাংলা)","en":"Deceased's name (Bangla)"},"type":"text"},{"constraints":{"maxLength":250,"minLength":2,"required":true},"evidence":{"fieldNames":["dead_info_name"],"source":"audit/evidence/s-31.json","status":"inferred"},"id":"dead_info_name","label":{"bn":"মৃত ব্যক্তির নাম (ইংরেজি)","en":"Deceased's name (English)"},"type":"text"},{"constraints":{"maxLength":250,"minLength":2,"required":true},"evidence":{"fieldNames":["dead_info_father_name_bn"],"source":"audit/evidence/s-31.json","status":"inferred"},"id":"dead_info_father_name_bn","label":{"bn":"মৃত ব্যক্তির পিতার নাম (বাংলা)","en":"Deceased's father's name (Bangla)"},"type":"text"},{"constraints":{"maxLength":250,"minLength":2,"required":true},"evidence":{"fieldNames":["dead_info_father_name"],"source":"audit/e