  (37, 6, $svjson${"evidence":{"limitation":"Complete all required fields before submitting. Version 3 (CERT-REFINE-01) adds the certificate QA refinement data slots. Version 4 (QAFIX-01) enters the application purpose once with a language choice, seats Bangla/English companion fields beside each other, unifies the document-language label and applies the live-QA spelling corrections. Version 5 (QAFIX-08) aligns the previous-voter-area pair: the English companion is a required text field with the Bangla original's limits, instead of an optional textarea — one required-ness rule per pair, and the pair the issuance gate checks is always complete. The certificate prints the identity (name, parents, NID) from the citizen record, so no identity fields are added to the form. Version 6 (QAFIX-10) captures the NID number and date of birth, overturning the QAFIX-08 decision to carry no identity fields — the live QA found no identity asked or re-confirmed anywhere. The certificate's fields line prints the NID from the citizen identity record, so the form fields are the citizen's re-confirmation; the date of birth prefills from the profile through the existing mapping, the NID cannot prefill (masked hint only).","source":"audit/evidence/s-37.json","status":"proposed"},"sections":[{"fields":[{"constraints":{"maxLength":17,"minLength":10,"required":true},"evidence":{"status":"proposed"},"id":"nid_number","label":{"bn":"জাতীয় পরিচয়পত্র (এনআইডি) নম্বর","en":"National ID (NID) number"},"type":"text"},{"constraints":{"notFuture":true,"required":true},"evidence":{"status":"proposed"},"id":"date_of_birth","label":{"bn":"জন্ম তারিখ","en":"Date of birth"},"type":"date"},{"constraints":{"required":true},"evidence":{"fieldNames":["application_voter_area_transfer_reason"],"source":"audit/evidence/s-37.json","status":"inferred"},"id":"application_voter_area_transfer_reason","label":{"bn":"ভোটার এলাকা স্থানান্তরের কারণ","en":"Application voter area transfer reason"},"options":[{"label":{"bn