  (40, 6, $svjson${"evidence":{"limitation":"Complete all required fields before submitting. Version 3 (CERT-REFINE-01) adds the certificate QA refinement data slots. Version 4 (QAFIX-01) enters the application purpose once with a language choice, seats Bangla/English companion fields beside each other, unifies the document-language label and applies the live-QA spelling corrections. Version 5 (QAFIX-08) takes the community from the fixed list of recognised communities shared with service 18 (the certificate resolves the code through its label map; older free-text applications still print verbatim), states the basis of membership as a fixed select, and makes the documents step name acceptable tribal-identity proof and require at least one upload. Version 6 (QAFIX-10) removes the religions (Muslim, Hindu, Buddhist, Christian) from the shared recognised-community list — they are religions, not communities — and adds an English community-name field, required when 'Other' is chosen (a listed community's English name already prints from the certificate's label map). The label map keeps the removed codes so applications pinned to earlier versions still render.","source":"audit/evidence/s-40.json","status":"proposed"},"sections":[{"fields":[{"constraints":{"required":true},"evidence":{"fieldNames":["community_name","community_name_en"],"status":"proposed"},"id":"community_name","label":{"bn":"সম্প্রদায়ের নাম","en":"Declared indigenous community"},"options":[{"label":{"bn":"চাকমা","en":"Chakma"},"value":"chakma"},{"label":{"bn":"মারমা","en":"Marma"},"value":"marma"},{"label":{"bn":"ত্রিপুরা","en":"Tripura"},"value":"tripura"},{"label":{"bn":"তঞ্চঙ্গ্যা","en":"Tanchangya"},"value":"tanchangya"},{"label":{"bn":"বড়ুয়া","en":"Barua"},"value":"barua"},{"label":{"bn":"ম্রো","en":"Mro"},"value":"mro"},{"label":{"bn":"বম","en":"Bawm"},"value":"bawm"},{"label":{"bn":"খুমি","en":"Khumi"},"value":"khumi"},{"label":{"bn":"চাক","en":"Chak"},"value":"chak"},{"label":{"bn":"পাংখো","en"