  (42, 7, $svjson${"evidence":{"limitation":"Complete all required fields before submitting. Version 2 maps all 37 observed trade entry and renewal fields. Version 3 selects division, district, upazila and (for union addresses) union from the supplied community geography dataset; urban, postal and additional-thana references remain free text. Version 4 (CERT-REFINE-01) adds the certificate QA refinement data slots. Version 5 (QAFIX-01) enters the application purpose once with a language choice, seats Bangla/English companion fields beside each other, unifies the document-language label and applies the live-QA spelling corrections. Version 6 (QAFIX-08) removes the eight citizen-typed fee fields (fees are system-set only) and the proprietor's mother/father/spouse name fields copied from a family form, makes the organisation type a fixed bilingual select the licence resolves through its label map, and adds the standard purpose-and-language section so the document language is the citizen's choice. Version 7 (QAFIX-10) normalises the \"permanent address\" option label to the single precomposed য় (U+09DF) form, ending the two-encoding split across services. Nothing else changes.","source":"audit/evidence/s-42.json","status":"proposed"},"sections":[{"fields":[{"constraints":{"maxLength":200,"minLength":2,"required":true},"evidence":{"fieldNames":["trade_license_org_name_bn"],"source":"audit/evidence/s-42.json","status":"inferred"},"id":"business_name_bn","label":{"bn":"প্রতিষ্ঠানের নাম (বাংলা)","en":"Business name (Bangla)"},"type":"text"},{"constraints":{"maxLength":200,"minLength":2,"required":true},"evidence":{"fieldNames":["trade_license_org_name"],"source":"audit/evidence/s-42.json","status":"inferred"},"id":"business_name_en","label":{"bn":"প্রতিষ্ঠানের নাম (ইংরেজি)","en":"Business name (English)"},"type":"text"},{"constraints":{"required":true},"evidence":{"fieldNames":["nature_of_business"],"source":"audit/evidence/s-42.json","status":"inferred"},"id":"business_typ