  (43, 6, $svjson${"evidence":{"limitation":"Complete all required fields before submitting. Version 3 (CERT-REFINE-01) adds the certificate QA refinement data slots. Version 4 (QAFIX-01) enters the application purpose once with a language choice, seats Bangla/English companion fields beside each other, unifies the document-language label and applies the live-QA spelling corrections. Version 5 (QAFIX-09) captures the dropped voter entry's identifiers (voter ID, serial, ward and the date of omission), tells the citizen what the previous-voter reference field is for, and makes the English omission details required like its Bangla original. The certificate prints the omission-reason pair only, so the identifiers are the office's lookup evidence. Version 6 (QAFIX-10) seats the English description beside its Bangla pair: both halves are now text fields, because the form grid spans every textarea across the full row, so no textarea pair can sit side by side. Labels and limits are unchanged, and the issuance gate still sees both halves required. The pair is also seated in one grid row by moving omission_ward_no to just after the English half — a pair starting in the second column straddles the row boundary, so the type change alone does not seat it.","source":"audit/evidence/s-43.json","status":"proposed"},"sections":[{"fields":[{"constraints":{"maxLength":500,"minLength":2,"required":true},"description":{"bn":"আগের ভোটার এলাকার নাম লিখুন — যে এলাকার ভোটার তালিকায় আপনার নাম ছিল।","en":"Write the name of your previous voter area — the area in whose voter list your name appeared."},"evidence":{"status":"proposed"},"id":"previous_voter_reference","label":{"bn":"পূর্বের ভোটার তথ্যের পরিচিতি","en":"Previous voter reference"},"type":"text"},{"constraints":{"maxLength":30,"required":true},"id":"previous_voter_id","label":{"bn":"ভোটার আইডি নম্বর","en":"Voter ID number"},"type":"text"},{"constraints":{"maxLength":30},"id":"previous_voter_serial","label":{"bn":"ভোটার সিরিয়াল নম্বর